* Scenarios in player animations

** Current animation is complete
   - Higher Priority state has come -> Switch immediately to next state
   - Lower Priority state has come -> Switch immediately to next state

** Current animation is not complete
   - Higher Priority state has come -> Switch immediately to next state
   - Lower Priority state has come
   -- Wait till the current animation gets complete
   -- Switch to next animation

** When is the player animation considered complete
   - When it has given fill frame duration to the last frame of the animation
